        "original_id": "de04d508-5843-5048-9bf5-542879ba3118",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Davis, Guillermo del Toro, Burn Gorman, John Barrowman, Eve Myles, Naoko Mori, Gareth David Lloyd, Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, Thomas Tull, Matthew Robbins\n- Works: Pacific Rim, Crimson Peak, Torchwood, To the Last Man, Game of Thrones, The Dark Knight Rises\n- Roles: Dr. Hermann Gottlieb, Mr. Holly, Dr. Owen Harper, Karl Tanner, Phillip Stryver, Major Edmund Hewlett, Toshiko Sato\n\nFacts:\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Owen Harper in the BBC series \"Torchwood\" from 2006 to 2008.\n- The \"Torchwood\" episode \"To the Last Man\" featured series regulars John Barrowman, Eve Myles, Burn Gorman, Naoko Mori, and Gareth David Lloyd, and it gave the main focus to Naoko Mori's character Toshiko Sato.\n- Burn Gorman played Phillip Stryver in \"The Dark Knight Rises\" in 2012.\n- Guillermo del Toro collaborated with Guy Davis on the films \"Pacific Rim\" and \"Crimson Peak\".\n- Burn Gorman played Dr. Hermann Gottlieb in \"Pacific Rim\" in 2013.\n- Burn Gorman played Karl Tanner in the HBO series \"Game of Thrones\" from 2013 to 2014.\n- Burn Gorman played Major Edmund Hewlett in the AMC series \"Turn\" in 2014.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" is a 2015 American gothic romance film directed, co-produced, and co-written by Guillermo del Toro.\n- \"Crimson Peak\" was also co-produced by Callum Greene, Jon Jashni, and Thomas Tull, and co-written by Matthew Robbins.\n- Burn Gorman played Mr. Holly in \"Crimson Peak\" in 2015.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
