        "text": "Page: Guy Davis (comics). Sentence: He is best known for his collaborations with director Guillermo del Toro, including the films \"Pacific Rim\" and \"Crimson Peak\".\nPage: Crimson Peak. Sentence: Crimson Peak is a 2015 American gothic romance film directed, co-produced and co-written by Guillermo del Toro, co-produced by Callum Greene, Jon Jashni and Thomas Tull and co-written by Matthew Robbins.\nPage: Burn Gorman. Sentence: He is known for his roles as Dr. Owen Harper in the BBC series \"Torchwood\" (2006–08), Karl Tanner in the HBO series \"Game of Thrones\" (2013–14), Phillip Stryver in \"The Dark Knight Rises\" (2012), Dr. Hermann Gottlieb in \"Pacific Rim\" (2013), Major Edmund Hewlett in the AMC series \"\" (2014), and Mr. Holly in \"Crimson Peak\" (2015).\nPage: To the Last Man (Torchwood). Sentence: As with all episodes of \"Torchwood\"' s first two series, \"To the Last Man\" featured series regulars John Barrowman, Eve Myles, Burn Gorman, Naoko Mori and Gareth David Lloyd, with Mori's character Toshiko Sato given the main focus.",
